<p>As I step down from my role, I’m eager to dedicate more time to my scientific pursuits. I am deeply grateful to the HMS-CSSA community for helping me adjust to life in Boston. I cherish the friendships I’ve made and the valuable experience I’ve gained in organizing and hosting scientific seminars.</p>

